  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-model-list-search",
      "text": "A client-only DeepSeek Harness plugin that adds a **Search models…** field to the composer model picker."
    },
    {
      "section": "Behavior",
      "text": "- Focuses the search field when the picker opens to its model list.\n- Filters model names and descriptions as you type, case-insensitively.\n- Preserves provider headings only when they contain a matching model.\n- Press `/` to focus search; press `Escape` once to clear the query.\n- Does not change model configuration or selection behavior."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add /Users/nathan/dsh-plugins/dsh-model-list-search\n```\n\nRestart DSH Desktop after installation. Then open the composer model picker, choose **Model**, and start typing."
    },
    {
      "section": "Test",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm test\n```"
    }
